N:Verse and chorus. Melody from the channel labeled Melody in a MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com, track 352558357619251), moved up a fourth from D minor to G minor so the low A3 lands on D4. Single source: no second arrangement was found. Chords from its Rhodes and bass channels; the turnaround at the end of each verse half is the arrangement's chromatic climb (Eb, Em7, Fm7, F#m7) up to the tonic. The flat fifth (D-flat) in bars 9 and 15 is in the source. The MIDI runs at 82 bpm; Q is set to the record's tempo instead. Humanized onsets snapped to the sixteenth grid; releases up to an eighth short of the next note are filled in.
